# U34: SortItemList, Ctrl+V / AddDisplayItem, Ctrl+F (allflame_exp_001). "Sort" (SortItemList:
# primary slot order, equipped slot, set, name; then AddUndoState), snapshot; paste a rare helmet
# and Ctrl+V (Draw L1461-1465: the CreateDisplayItemFromRaw stand-in), "Add to build"
# (AddDisplayItem: a new id; the Helmet slot is taken, so no auto-equip), snapshot; Ctrl+F three
# times (Draw L1478-1487: the unique DB search, the rare DB search with the selector on "Rare
# Templates", the unique DB again), typing into each focused search; search "hooves" and
# Ctrl+click Abberath's Hooves (U32's OnSelClick: AddItem, equip, U34's
# AddForbiddenJewelCounterpart (no counterpart), PopulateSlots, AddUndoState), snapshot.
# (The Forbidden Flame/Flesh uniques are generated by Data/Uniques/Special/Generated.lua, which
# the Rust unique DB does not have yet, so the counterpart is not exercised here.)
#! u34-expect display: Doom Crown
#! u34-expect undo: 3 redo: 0 mod: true
#! u34-expect ^7def
#! u34-expect undo: 4 redo: 0 mod: true
